00:01:19.845 --> 00:01:22.348
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-"Felons galore."

00:01:24.116 --> 00:01:25.218
It's a great name.

00:01:27.152 --> 00:01:29.321
No, he was mean.
He's called the... (LAUGHS)

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.790
